#	Origin: EmberBSD (Linux 6.18 i915 driver)
#
# DRAFT of the file list of the i915 driver of Linux 6.18 (dist618/drm/i915)
# for config(1): the 303 sources of the working set for Arrow Lake 8086:7d67
# (everything of the directory except gvt, the self tests, pxp and the files
# that need a GPL-licensed source: intel_acpi.c, the trace points).  Not
# included from sys/conf/files and not used by any module yet: the driver has
# no autoconfiguration glue and does not link.
#
# The first block compiles against the layer (clang -c, the flags of the
# drmkms618 module); the second is not yet there, the reason in the comment is
# the first compiler error.  The count is in drm618/README.
#
# Written by hand from the measurement of the compile progress; regenerate
# with the measurement script when the layer grows.

